DAY 26 — WEB MINI-PENTEST

OBJECTIVE:
Perform an end-to-end web pentest on an authorized lab.

WORKFLOW:
Nmap → Web Mapping → Burp → Vulnerability Testing → Evidence

RECON:
nmap -sC -sV <TARGET>

Record:
IP
Open ports
Services/versions
Web endpoints

BURP:
Proxy → HTTP History → Repeater

Inspect:
Method
Path
Parameters
Cookies
Headers
Response

TESTING:
Baseline request → Change ONE thing → Compare response → Confirm behavior

FOCUS:
IDOR / Broken Access Control
SQL Injection
XSS
CSRF
File Upload
Path Traversal

EVIDENCE:
Finding
Endpoint/parameter
Normal vs changed behavior
Status/response
Impact
Screenshot

KEY RULE:
Map first → Test carefully → Confirm → Document.
